error[E0277]: `ActorRef<Asked>` cannot take a held `Other` for `Ask`
  --> tests/ui/rejects_hands_off_to_a_different_reply.rs:70:32
   |
70 |     Held::<Other>(PhantomData).hand_off(asked, &Ask { seq: 1 });
   |                                ^^^^^^^^ no row of this target answers `Ask` with `Other`
   |
   = note: a held reply hands off to an `ActorRef<T>` whose handler for `Ask` replies `Other`, or a `ProtocolRef<P>` whose row for `Ask` is `Row<Ask, Other>`; an `ErasedActorRef` proves no row (#6895)
